Description: local-first tree-structured note-taking application
 OmaTree is a deliberately simple note-taking application: a tree of notes
 on the left and the selected note on the right. Every note can have child
 notes, so ideas branch the way your thinking does.
 .
 Notes are plain text with a read-only Markdown preview. A notebook is a
 single local .omatree file; there is no account and no cloud service.
